# All the files

## Download

| Zip | What |
|---|---|
| [interactive-3d-slides.zip](../../code/interactive-3d-slides.zip) | Everything: the bridge, the six examples with their web builds, the tests and the build scripts |
| [a1-opengl-cube.zip](../../code/a1-opengl-cube.zip) | [1. A turning cube](../../01_tutorial/02_cube/index.html), with the CMake module and glad |
| [a2-opengl-uniforms.zip](../../code/a2-opengl-uniforms.zip) | [2. Uniforms driven live](../../01_tutorial/03_panel/index.html) |
| [c1-cgp-template.zip](../../code/c1-cgp-template.zip) | [3. A CGP program](../../01_tutorial/04_cgp/index.html), with the build script of the CGP examples |
| [c3-cgp-waving-surface.zip](../../code/c3-cgp-waving-surface.zip) | [4. Buttons in the slide](../../01_tutorial/05_buttons/index.html) |
| [c6-cgp-marching-cubes.zip](../../code/c6-cgp-marching-cubes.zip) | [5. ImGui in the room](../../01_tutorial/06_imgui/index.html) |
| [c7-cgp-drag-points.zip](../../code/c7-cgp-drag-points.zip) | [6. Values sent back to the slide](../../01_tutorial/07_readout/index.html) |

Each zip unpacks into `interactive-3d-slides/`, with the same folders as the repository: the commands of the
pages work from there.

