## The example talks

The same demos in two slide tools:

- [in reveal.js](../../decks/reveal.js/index.html), four slides: plain `<iframe>`s, and buttons that name their
  demo (`data-demo="#surface"`);
- [in lhtml-site](../../decks/lhtml-site/html/index.html), five slides, and [their PDF](../../decks/lhtml-site/slides.pdf),
  where each demo is replaced by its poster.
